  "boundary": "Native QKeySequenceEdit/Z_KeySequenceEdit captures a candidate only. Native key parsing, up-to-four chords, recording timer and signals remain Qt 5.15.2 authority; QAction/QShortcut command binding and an external registry own assignment/conflicts/scope/reserved keys. Adapter clear calls QKeySequenceEdit::clear, not internal lineEdit clear. No Qt6 clearButtonEnabled/maximumSequenceLength API is invented. Source snapshots preserve authored spaced Sequence text; live display and PortableText roundtrip remain Qt-owned. Source Focus hint says release to commit; runtime hint describes native settle delay. No public type/normalization/approval promotion."
}
